---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Network policy

Usage: bento policy [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init      Choose the network policy for all sandboxes
  allow     Allow network access
  deny      Deny network access
  rm        Remove rules [aliases: remove, delete]
  ls        List rules [alias: list]
  inspect   Show one rule
  log       Show requests the policy blocked
  check     Test whether a host is allowed
  reset     Remove every rule and the chosen mode
  approval  Blocked hosts waiting for a decision
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Enable debug logging: each smolvm call, and SMOLBENTO_LOG at info unless set

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

  -h, --help
          Print help
